---
title: SD-07 Dashboard - View Dashboard
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (any role)
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as Dashboard API
    participant S as DashboardService
    participant D as SQL Server
    U->>F: Open dashboard
    F->>A: GET /api/dashboard (JWT)
    A->>A: Authorize and read role from token
    A->>S: GetDashboard(role)
    S->>D: Count products, categories, suppliers
    S->>D: Sum completed sales (today, month, all time)
    S->>D: Products with stock <= reorder level
    S->>D: Batches expired or expiring within 30 days
    D-->>S: Query results
    S->>S: Keep only the widgets allowed for the role
    S-->>A: Dashboard DTO
    A-->>F: 200 OK + JSON
    F-->>U: Render stat cards, low-stock and expiry lists
    Note over S,D: Voided sales are excluded from sales totals
